/**
 * Calculates the area of a triangle given one side length and its corresponding height.
 *
 * @param {number} a - Length of the side.
 * @param {number} h - Height corresponding to that side.
 * @returns {number} The area of the triangle.
 * @throws {TypeError} If either argument is not a number.
